      "en": "“When the children of your people speak to you, saying, ‘Won’t you show us what you mean by these?’",
      "ko": "네 민족이 네게 말하여 이르기를 이것이 무슨 뜻인지 우리에게 고하지 아니하겠느냐 하거든",
      "source_text_hash": "1c2d995e925599b50a16093d634b53b29d1b9e79aafeb922e8e6939d1af3d461",
      "translation_text_hash": "cf0323c2b8109ad37bcb8c5432d1fc14bf00baf99c5ec7fb4b4fa54a27aafd51",
