      "en": "The sticks on which you write will be in your hand before their eyes.”’",
      "ko": "너는 그 글 쓴 막대기들을 무리의 목전에서 손에 잡고",
      "source_text_hash": "58e08244d0231232ee909ec92f77490e6c64d31dd6e52bd63743f1efd2e2d399",
      "translation_text_hash": "5d1b83d995cf7ae79fc842d99920b03387790640bdc9f94e5ccdf2fc240ad3ee",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
